	(text "Rev A, 2026-10-07. Design: docs/design-v6/2026-10-06-power-circuit.md;\nchecks: docs/design-v6/2026-10-07-power-board-verification.md.\nKelvin-route SRP/SRN (R7, R8) to the pads of R1, and CS+, CS-, ISCP to R24. Q5 against Q3, RT1 by Q1/Q2.\nCheck against the real parts before ordering: XT60 polarity (J1), balance-lead order (J2),\nservo-header orientation (J4-J8 must mate like the General Driver's H5: D V G).\nThe BQ76922 protects without the host only after its OTP is programmed (BAT 10-12 V)."
